# The program of ../../answers is one in which loops are separated from their unlikely paths, stretches are copied with ways back, allocations are merged at joins, objects and lists stay in frames and a text is built in a builder.
# FORM: AsRead
# RUN: compile
# STATISTIC: LoopsSeparatedFromUnlikelyPaths >= 1
# STATISTIC: WaysBackFromStretchCopies >= 1
# STATISTIC: AllocationsMergedAtJoins >= 1
# STATISTIC: ObjectsInFrames >= 1
# STATISTIC: ArraysInFrames >= 1
# STATISTIC: StringBuildersCreated >= 1
# CHECK: image not empty
# PROGRAM-OF: ../../answers/loops-leaving-and-rejoining-fast-copy.ir
